# Under Construction", an "Optional Vessel" in the Q1 6-K ex 99.1 table) carries
# NO contract date in the release — UNVERIFIED (shadow): awaits the 6-K
# Subsequent Events / commitments note (MB LNG Weekly 29, 2026-07-16, would
# place it post-quarter); NOT counted in the 6/30 orderbook here. The release
# table has no contract price, remaining commitment or instalment schedule.
#   - Advances paid at Jun-30-2026: 470,050 ($K) — release BALANCE SHEET DATA
